<title>USA: CMI names Albert Basey president.</title>
<headline>CMI names Albert Basey president.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>CMI Corp said on Tuesday it has named Albert Basey president and chief operating officer, a newly created position.</p>
<p>Basey was previously president of AT&amp;T Corp's switching systems unit, CMI said.</p>
